    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（投石索），非普通</em><br />当你用这把魔法投石索发动的攻击检定命中了一个 巨人Giant 生物，那个生物必须通过一次[[/save ability=con dc=18]]豁免，豁免失败就将陷入 倒地Prone 状态。<br />（译者注：巨人生物=生物类型为巨人的生物）</p><p>When you hit a Giant creature with a ranged attack roll using this magic sling, the creature must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=18]] saving throw or have the prone condition.</p></div>",
